  "text": "Unlike its namesake, the peacock phoenix is a being of pure magic, a unique manifestation of Xanderghul's alter ego as the Peacock Spirit.\nOther Mythic Phoenixes\nBecause it's tied so intrinsically to Runelord Xanderghul and his alter ego, the Peacock Spirit, once the peacock phoenix is destroyed, it's doubtful Golarion will ever see its like again. Whether different kinds of mythic phoenixes, born from similar confluences of magical and psychic energy, could ever exist remains uncertain."
